      "machineText": "Wails v3 中*没有*包级对话框构造函数——每个对话框都通过`app.Dialog`管理器创建。在服务中，通过`application.Get()`获取应用（它会返回正在运行的`*application.App`）：",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In Wails v3 there are *no* package-level dialog constructors — every dialog is created through the `…",
