      "machineText": "对应的方法是用于消息对话框的`app.Dialog.Info() / Question() / Warning() / Error()`，以及用于文件对话框的`app.Dialog.OpenFile() / SaveFile()`（还有`*WithOptions`变体）。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The matching methods are `app.Dialog.Info() / Question() / Warning() / Error()` for message dialogs …",
